Package: catmech
Title: Auditable Model-Based Imputation and Category Sensitivity
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Patrick", "Iben", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "295464172+patrickiben@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Auditable Gaussian imputation of a continuous measurement with
    flagged values excluded and optional exact or fallible interval categories.
    Provides posterior predictive draws, category-likelihood data augmentation,
    convergence diagnostics, finite-scenario sensitivity comparisons and 'mice'
    analysis adapters. Retains an explicitly separate experimental predictive
    mean matching sensitivity engine. Does not identify individual latent truth,
    estimate corruption probabilities, or guarantee coverage under misspecification.
